And remember, if you grab it quick and manage to cop the premium limited set, you'll get a hand-signed postcard from me!

1174
01:45:57,683 --> 01:45:59,503
Pretty kawaii, happy!

1175
01:45:59,503 --> 01:46:01,923
But like always, supplies are extreme--

